# Preconditions, Safety Boundary & Per-Case Execution Loop

> Topic: Reviewed revision and environment preconditions (`A1`, `A7`), read-only and safe test-account boundaries (`A2`, `A13`), per-case execution loop with persistence read-back (`A3`, `A4`), revision-bound evidence (`A8`), and `PASS`/`FAIL`/`BLOCKED`/`NOT_RUN` grading (`A9`) for {{project_name}}.

